          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content4\" group=\"Content\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video'&&bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"11\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1-1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background13.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"title col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">\n                    <b>How Does Quietum Plus Works?</b></h3>\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle align-center mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><div>Sugar Defender operates through a multi-mechanism approach to assist the body in regulating blood sugar levels and maintaining balanced cellular energy throughout the day. High blood sugar spikes often result from erratic insulin release, cellular insulin resistance, and sluggish carbohydrate metabolism. The supplement integrates essential trace minerals along with specialized plant-derived bioactive compounds that interact directly with metabolic pathways to improve insulin sensitivity, aiding glucose transportation into cells for clean energy rather than storing it as unwanted fat.&nbsp; &nbsp;</div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 22.4px;\">The active ingredients in Sugar Defender work to combat oxidative stress and cellular inflammation, both of which are primary drivers of metabolic dysfunction and erratic glucose levels. By lowering oxidative damage within pancreatic cells, the body can maintain more consistent insulin secretion. Additionally, key botanical extracts in the formula help dull taste receptors to minimize sugar cravings, making it easier for individuals to follow a balanced, low-glycemic dietary regimen without constantly fighting intense urges for sweets.&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 22.4px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 22.4px;\">In addition to regulating glucose spikes, Sugar Defender focuses on sustaining natural vitality without causing jittery energy crashes. Many traditional blood sugar supplements use high levels of artificial stimulants to mask fatigue, but Sugar Defender blends subtle adaptogens and nutrient catalysts that boost cellular mitochondrial function. This metabolic support ensures that blood sugar remains within a healthy target range after meals, keeping energy production steady throughout busy daily routines.&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 22.4px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 22.4px;\">Furthermore, Sugar Defender supports digestive and hepatic health to optimize how carbohydrates and fats are processed by the liver. The liver plays a crucial role in glycogen storage and release; when liver pathways are overburdened, blood sugar balance becomes unpredictable. By supporting hepatic metabolism, Sugar Defender ensures that stored glycogen is converted to usable energy efficiently, reducing sharp mid-day fatigue and promoting consistent metabolic stability.&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 22.4px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 22.4px;\">Finally, the cumulative long-term effect of Sugar Defender lies in its ability to support vascular and circulatory wellness alongside blood glucose management. Elevated blood sugar over extended periods can irritate micro-blood vessels and slow down circ&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></div><br><div><span style=\"font-size: 22.4px;\">ulation. By promoting smoother endothelial function and improving cellular nutrient uptake, Sugar Defender provides comprehensive support to help keep blood sugar, metabolic rate, and overall cardiovascular health aligned.</span></div></h4>\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-center\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\">LEARN MORE</a>\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary-outline\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\">LIVE DEMO</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
