        {
          "_name": "content8",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "background-color": "@bgColor",
            ".counter-container": {
              "ul": {
                "margin": "0",
                "list-style": "none",
                "padding-left": "2.5rem",
                "li": {
                  "margin-bottom": "1rem",
                  "position": "relative",
                  "& when (@stylizedCounters)": {
                    "list-style": "none",
                    "position": "relative",
                    "padding-left": "1rem",
                    "&:before": {
                      "position": "absolute",
                      "left": "-40px",
                      "content": "\"\"",
                      "display": "flex",
                      "justify-content": "center",
                      "align-items": "center",
                      "color": "contrast(@iconColor)",
                      "background-color": "@iconColor",
                      "width": "40px",
                      "height": "40px",
                      "border-radius": "50%",
                      "margin-top": "5px",
                      "& when (@countersType = \"circle\")": {
                        "background": "none",
                        "border": "1px solid @iconColor",
                        "color": "@iconColor"
                      },
                      "& when (@countersType = \"square\")": {
                        "border-radius": "0"
                      },
                      "& when (@mark)": {
                        "content": "\"✓\""
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "& when not (@stylizedCounters)": {
                    "&:before": {
                      "position": "absolute",
                      "left": "-1.6rem",
                      "content": "\"\\2022\"",
                      "color": "@iconColor",
                      "font-weight": "bold",
                      "font-size": "2rem",
                      "width": "1.6rem",
                      "line-height": "1.2"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            ".mbr-text UL": {
              "text-align": "justify"
            }
          },
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content8\" group=\"Content\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"11\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Stylized\" name=\"stylizedCounters\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Mark\" name=\"mark\" checked condition=\"stylizedCounters\">\n        <select title=\"Type\" name=\"countersType\" condition=\"stylizedCounters\">\n            <option value=\"default\" selected>Сircle Fill</option>\n            <option value=\"circle\">Circle</option>\n            <option value=\"square\">Square</option>\n        </select>\n        <input type=\"color\" name=\"iconColor\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#1f436d\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"counter-container col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">\n                    Shape your future web project with the Mobirise app.\n                </h4>\n                <div class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                    <ul>\n                        <li><span style=\"font-size: 20.8px;\">Relief from Burning and Shooting Pain</span>By utilizing powerful botanical calming agents and antioxidants such as Alpha Lipoic Acid and Capsaicin, Nerve Alive works to desensitize overactive pain receptors and modulate TRPV1 signals. This alleviates persistent burning sensations, sharp shooting pains, and hypersensitivity to touch in extremitiesPromotes Restful, Uninterrupted Sleep: Frequent nighttime urination can severely disrupt sleep cycles. Prosta Defend supports bladder comfort and nighttime urinary control, which may help reduce the number of nighttime bathroom trips. Better sleep quality leads to improved energy, mood, and overall daily performance.</li><li>Nerve AliveEnhanced Micro-Circulation<span style=\"font-size: calc(1.14rem + 0.26 * ((100vw - 62rem) / 25));\">Nerve cells rely heavily on steady oxygen and nutrient delivery to thrive. Nerve Alive contains specialized circulatory-boosting extracts that improve micro-vascular blood flow to peripheral nerves, soothing cold feet and hands while accelerating tissue recovery.Encourages Long-Term Prostate Health: Rather than offering temporary relief, Prosta Defend focuses on long-term prostate wellness. Its ingredients support cellular health and antioxidant protection, helping maintain prostate function as part of a healthy aging routine.</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 20.8px;\">&nbsp;Restorative Nighttime Sleep Nerve discomfort frequently flares up at night, disrupting restorative sleep cycles. Ingredients like Passionflower and Magnesium Glycinate help calm hyper-active nerves and reduce physical restlessness, allowing users to fall asleep faster and enjoy deep, uninterrupted nighttime sleep</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 20.8px;\">Improved Mobility and Balance</span>&nbsp;As nerve signal clarity improves and foot/hand numbness subsides, users regain greater tactile awareness, physical coordination, and balance. This increased physical comfort makes daily walking, standing, and physical activity significantly easier and pain-free.</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
